      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>full defines configuration parameters for the IPsec <code>Full</code> mode. This is permitted only when mode is configured with <code>Full</code>, and forbidden otherwise.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
      </dl>
      <Table class="my-4">
