      <TableCell>internalJoinSubnet is a v4 subnet used internally by ovn-kubernetes in case the default one is being already used by something else. It must not overlap with any other subnet being used by OpenShift or by the node network. The size of the subnet must be larger than the number of nodes. The current default value is 100.64.0.0/16 The subnet must be large enough to accommodate one IP per node in your cluster The value must be in proper IPV4 CIDR format</TableCell>
